OL,3,GNEWSAFinancial services firm to cut 114
OL,4,Ajobs as part of 'proposed
OL,5,Arestructuring'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFinancial services company FinTrU is
OL,8,Fcutting jobs in Northern Ireland as
OL,9,Fpart of a "proposed restructuring".
OL,11,FIn a letter seen by BBC News NI, the
OL,12,FFinancial Services Union (FSU) raised
OL,13,Fconcerns around the fairness of the
OL,14,Fconsultation process.
OL,16,FThe company provides support services,
OL,17,Fincluding compliance and risk
OL,18,Fmanagement, to major banks from offices
OL,19,Fin Belfast, Londonderry, Letterkenny in
OL,20,Fthe Republic of Ireland and Porto in
OL,21,FPortugal.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
