OL,3,GNEWSAFinancial services firm to cut 114
OL,4,Ajobs as part of 'proposed
OL,5,Arestructuring'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe FSU understands 95 employees in
OL,8,FBelfast are at risk and a further 19
OL,9,Fare at risk in Londonderry.
